OL,3,AJailed Pakistan ex-PM Imran Khan taken
OL,4,Ato hospital for treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Pakistani Prime Minister Imran
OL,7,FKhan has been taken to a hospital in
OL,8,Fthe capital, Islamabad, following
OL,9,Fcomplaints about his poor health.
OL,11,FKhan was taken from Adiala jail and
OL,12,Fsent to Shifa International Hospital
OL,13,Funder heavy security, according to his
OL,14,Fparty. There is yet to be official
OL,15,Fconfirmation he has been transferred.
OL,17,FThe move complied with a ruling by a
OL,18,Fthree-judge panel of the Supreme Court
OL,19,Fwhich had ordered that the
OL,20,Fcricketer-turned-politician be taken to
OL,21,Fthe hospital within 48 hours to be
OL,22,Fexamined by physicians.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
