OL,3,AJailed Pakistan ex-PM Imran Khan taken
OL,4,Ato hospital for treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is the most significant relief
OL,7,FKhan has received from the courts since
OL,8,Fhe was imprisoned in 2023 on corruption
OL,9,Fcharges, which he says were politically
OL,10,Fmotivated.
